{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/extras/f19809022aa955a61d740cee97006bd9.avif?t=1749467484\" width=300 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong> \u00a0\u00a0</i><strong>It's a dog and it hates squares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/extras/5574f7c3ca71e8fe16b83c451eaeabb8.avif?t=1749467484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/extras_big/5574f7c3ca71e8fe16b83c451eaeabb8.avif?t=1749467484 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 You are the voice in it\u00a0 head and must help destroy all the squares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/extras/94aa13f240b5b6a4bd304844cf25bb0c.poster.avif?t=1749467484\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/extras/94aa13f240b5b6a4bd304844cf25bb0c.webm?t=1749467484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/extras/94aa13f240b5b6a4bd304844cf25bb0c.mp4?t=1749467484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong> \u00a0 <strong>This is Anton.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>akabos</strong></i> is a clicker game where you need to touch your dog to destroy squares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game has a plot and several endings that depend only on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has sound.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no saves and must be completed in one game session.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports mouse and keyboard.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"akabos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3294950/f6480a54ade687d6d3520f0772e05b03f55e29f5.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3294950?t=1749467484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3294950?t=1749467484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/a310c3a168b9f918e32d70a075635e05f609d7bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749467484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294950/a310c3a168b9f918e32d70a075635e05f609d7bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749467484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u